    <statement><p>An <em>anagram</em> of a word is just a rearrangement of its letters. How many different anagrams of <lq/>troublemakings<rq/> are there?</p>
<p><fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>14!</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>Since there are 14 different letters in <lq/>troublemakings<rq/>, we have 14 choices for the first letter, 13 for the next, 12 for the next, and so on. Thus there are <m>14!</m> anagrams.</p>
</solution>
